abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of the Lonely Runner
  Conjecture for up to seven runners, including arbitrary real speeds
  for n = 5, 6, 7.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - lonely runner conjecture
  - Diophantine approximation
